 "description": "<p>A pair of plush bracelets made for matching wear: black, pink, and red as the shade choices, one for each partner. The fabric is soft-loop plush with a lightweight feel that survives all-day wear, which is the actual test for couple accessories.</p>\n<p>The uses run wider than the obvious - matching sets for parties, photo shoots, anniversary weeks, or the quiet version where only two people know. At this price point it works as an add-on to any gift.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: plush fabric</li>\n<li>Item type: matching bracelet pair</li>\n<li>Color: black, pink, or red</li>\n<li>Fit: one size, elastic band</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One shade per pair, both bracelets included. The low-cost matching piece that turns two outfits into one statement.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Matching plush bracelet pair for couples in black, pink or red, soft elastic one-size band.</p>\n",
